# =============================================================================
# Replication package .gitignore
#
# Tracked (the replication package):
#   - Scripts/                 analysis pipelines + cross-pipeline RQ scripts
#   - results/RQ1|RQ2|RQ3/      result tables, stats CSVs, box/heatmap PDFs,
#                              aggregated metrics, organized by research question
#   - results/combined/        the 3-pipeline significance sweep
#   - python_data/succeeded/   the input patches (agent + gold) per model
#   - README.md
#
# The pipelines still write their raw output under Scripts/**/ (dpy_results/,
# pylint_results/, understand_results/, results/); those trees are ignored --
# the curated, RQ-organized copy under results/ is what ships. See results/README.md.
# =============================================================================

# --- internal dev notes (not part of the package) ---
CLAUDE.md

# --- manuscript + qualitative example bundles (kept out of the code package) ---
Paper/
rq3_examples/
instance_*/

# --- raw upstream evaluation data (get from the SWE-Bench Pro release) ---
data/
python_data/failed/

# --- checked-out repositories / environments ---
repos/
.venv/
venv/
env/
node_modules/

# --- deprecated / backup trees ---
old/
dpy_results_old/
Results/
/pylint_results/

# --- Python cruft ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.DS_Store

# --- SciTools Understand databases (large, regenerated) ---
*.und
*.udb
Scripts/**/understand_dbs/

# --- raw pipeline output (regenerated; curated copy lives in results/) ---
Scripts/DPY/dpy_results/
Scripts/Pylint/pylint_results/
Scripts/Understand/understand_results/
Scripts/results/

# --- LaTeX ---
*.tex
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.synctex.gz
*.log
